      "rationale": [
        "CAP-121 already names OpenCut and libopenshot as REQ-ADAPTER + REF providers, so this change materializes an existing baseline rather than adding a capability.",
        "OpenCut's declared Editor API, plugins, Rust core, MCP, headless and scripting direction aligns strongly with FA3's programmable editorial surface.",
        "The upstream rewrite does not yet expose stable versions of those interfaces; production admission is therefore fail-closed and requires a future immutable adapter/current-host evidence package.",
        "Kdenlive, OpenMontage, Temporal, NATS JetStream, Valkey, Central MCP and Host Resource Broker boundaries remain unchanged."
      ],
